      "writtenOn": "2024-03-08T00:02:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What breaks if you try to make it simpler (no \"LOCKED_WAITING\" state)?\n\n(Somewhat pseudocode, haven\u0027t totally thought it through.)\n\nlock:\n```\n\tatomic_or(\u0026mtx-\u003ewaiters, id);\n\n\tdo {\n\t        state \u003d MUTEX_R_UNLOCKED;\n\t\tatomic_compare_exchange(\u0026mtx,state, \u0026state, MUTEX_R_LOCKED);\n\t\t\n\t\tif (state \u003d\u003d MUTEX_R_LOCKED) {\n\t\t   mtx-\u003eowner \u003d current;\n\t\t   mtx-\u003ecount++;\n\t\t   break;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\t\ttask_wait_event_mask(TASK_EVENT_MUTEX, 0)\n\t} while (true);\n\n\tatomic_clear_bits(\u0026mtx-\u003ewaiters, id);\n```\n\nunlock:\n```\t\n\tmtx-\u003ecount--;\n\tif (mtx-\u003ecount \u003d\u003d 0) {\n\t\tmtx-\u003eowner \u003d -1;\n\n                atomic_exchange(\u0026mtx-\u003estate, MUTEX_R_UNLOCKED);\n                \n                waiters \u003d atomic_load(\u0026mtx-\u003ewaiters);\n                if (waiters) {\n\t\t\ttask_set_event(__fls(waiters),\n\t\t\t\t\t       TASK_EVENT_MUTEX);\n\t\t}\n\t}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 40,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "864eaf6e1eba86bfd4858d58b1a320f94b43183f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
