      "writtenOn": "2024-03-08T10:12:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Performance.\n\nCurrently, when locking unlocked mutex, it\u0027s just one atomic operation. Unlocking mutex with no waiters is also one atomic operation. My first implementation was similar to yours, but without `state` (`owner` was used to determine whether mutex is locked).",
      "parentUuid": "c9567145_6d15682b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
